{
  "about": "The source readers' refusals as core classifies them: the SAS reader's (SAS-7), the Dataset-JSON reader's (DSJSON-3, DSJSON-5), the CSV profile's and typing's (CSV-10, CSV-16, INPUT-6, INPUT-7), Parquet's (PARQUET-5 to PARQUET-9) and the YAML source's (SPEC-8, SCHEMA-3, VALUE-11). The adapters' suites pin which bytes give which refusal.",
